  - title: Caught on the doorstep
    number: 3
    heartsNeeded: 3
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - You were out early this morning, weren't you? Near Maple Lane?
    - Then you saw me. With the soup. On Sam's step.
    - Oh, don't look at me like that. Somebody has to make sure that young writer eats something that isn't noodles.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
