      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Bread for the whole street
    number: 6
    heartsNeeded: 6
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I've had an idea, and I need a farmer for it.
    - Every house on the street, one loaf each, all baked on the same morning. The way we used to do it when the street was new.
    - But I want real flour. Flour from wheat I can see growing. Would you bring me some?
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eca73beb07679c4409c779f9df491fc0, type: 2}
      amount: 10
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: Bread for the whole street
      questText: Rosa wants wheat from your farm to bake a loaf for every house on the street.
      reminder:
      - Any luck with the wheat, dear? Ten will do it. The oven's been looking at me.
      thanks:
      - Look at that! Proper wheat, with dirt still on it.
      - Come back tomorrow and you'll smell it from the farm. Here, take something warm for now.
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 23fbff7a9900e4f43a40e565bccb161d, type: 2}
      amount: 3
      friendship: 0
  - title: The bakery counter
    number: 7
    heartsNeeded: 7
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Have you seen? The tower's opened a bakery counter. Bread in plastic, three for the price of one.
    - Jae-hoon says nobody bought my loaves at the store yesterday. Not one. They've all gone to the tower for the plastic ones.
    - And you know... you can tell Sam about the soup now, if you like. I think I'm too tired to keep secrets.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
